Directory :
- gxinterface : ( source  )
	Start an user interface form an .ui file
	to know how read the HOWTOs
	For licences read the README and COPYING

- dx7interface : ( source  )
	Start an user interface form a .la and .ui files
	to know how read the HOWTO
	For licences read the README and COPYING
		
- dx7 : doc and utilities for dx7
	boucle_midi.mid :
		midi loop file to be use by boucle_midi script
	boucle_midi :
		script starting qjackctl, hexter, amidi and connecting pmidi on hexter
	usefull link :
		link on dx7 pages references 
	sysex2ins :
		script converting raw bank to instruments list .ins
	Table_sysex_dx7.ods :
		full spreedsheet of dx7 sysex
	bank_hexter :
		extracted sound of hexter from https://smbolton.com/hexter.html https://github.com/theabolton/hexter
	 
